{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your opponent in this turn-based card battler! Master the unique time frame mechanic - calculate when to take some risks, and exploit your opponent's hasty decisions. Explore a range of playable fighters with distinctive play styles, each of whom has their own unique move set, and might accompany that with some personal mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>Stage Fighting</strong>, a popular activity enjoyed by many from various backgrounds across this fictional Empire. For their own reasons, the fighters found themselves in this major city under the Empire's ruling. They came from a variety of professions and experiences - peacekeepers, actors, builders, and many more.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/7a0375187c3eab249f71508b5f200cf5.poster.avif?t=1757300883\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/7a0375187c3eab249f71508b5f200cf5.webm?t=1757300883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/7a0375187c3eab249f71508b5f200cf5.mp4?t=1757300883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LITE version features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New player guidance with Assistant<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/1b3154d5da39fb1e1022bcdf9c29b4fc.avif?t=1757300883\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play with/against 3 fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against Assistant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa